ADDITIONAL NOTICE - TRADING RISK: This software automates the placement of
real orders on cryptocurrency exchanges. Automated trading can lose money
quickly, including total loss of the funds in the connected account. Nothing
in this software is financial advice, and no profit or performance is
guaranteed or implied. Use paper mode until you fully understand the system,
never enable a live API key with withdrawal permissions, and only trade what
you can afford to lose.
